{"id":"da424a8bc726f148","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-set12-partial-choice-section.md","title":"ZFC Set12 Partial Choice Section","display":"df-zfc-set12-partial-choice-section — ZFC Set12 Partial Choice Section","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set12-partial-choice-section","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set12-partial-choice-section"],"display":"df-zfc-set12-partial-choice-section — ZFC Set12 Partial Choice Section","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-set11-choice-function-on-family.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set12-partial-choice-section"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set12-partial-choice-section</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set12-partial-choice-section — ZFC Set12 Partial Choice Section"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"06a181a549196b34\" href=\"?note=06a181a549196b34\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-set11-choice-function-on-family.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-set11-choice-function-on-family.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,\\mathcal A,D\\in V\">\\(s,\\mathcal A,D\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11ChoiceFunctionOnFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet11ChoiceFunctionOnFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"06a181a549196b34\" href=\"?note=06a181a549196b34\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-set11-choice-function-on-family.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-set11-choice-function-on-family.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12PartialChoiceSection}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12PartialChoiceSection}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}partial\\text{-}choice\\text{-}section}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12PartialChoiceSection}_S(s,\\mathcal A,D)\n\\leftrightarrow\nD\\subseteq\\mathcal A\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSet11ChoiceFunctionOnFamily}_S(s,D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}partial\\text{-}choice\\text{-}section}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet12PartialChoiceSection}_S(s,\\mathcal A,D)\n\\leftrightarrow\nD\\subseteq\\mathcal A\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcSet11ChoiceFunctionOnFamily}_S(s,D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> is a genuine function whose domain is the chosen subfamily <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>, and every member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> is nonempty.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-set11-choice-function-on-family.md","status":"resolved","id":"06a181a549196b34","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-d